      "title": "Energy Balance - customer ${customer_id}",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "Net = production - consumption per 15-min slot, as kW, across the customer's meters. One signed sum rather than four averages: a slot with only consumption rows would make the production term NULL and blank the series. cast(... AS DOUBLE) on the output column: the plugin has no DECIMAL converter, so an un-cast value arrives as a string and the panel reports \"Data is missing a number field\". The inner sum stays DECIMAL, where the exactness matters.",
